name: The Needle — single hand
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Needle lets you play only 1 hand (but score requirement is 1x base). Ante 2 boss:
  build one-shot big-hand power (Acrobat, Dusk, Baron/Mime).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheNeedle
    antes: [2]
should:
  - joker: Acrobat
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Dusk
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Baron
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
